		{
			dependencies: ["147F646960AE4EBE"]
			description: [
				"This tab of quests is designed to really get into the weeds with the main &d\"Path To Null\"&r quest line. These quests are entirely ignorable if you are experienced or are willing to scramble your brains a bit &bbut for anyone feeling lost or unsure how to progress&a this is for you!&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"No berries will be rewarded &b(outside of this one quest)&r but you will be provided with as much context and information as needed. &6Vanilla mechanics will be explained&r, no knowledge assumptions will be made."
				""
				"Eventually ponders will be created for most things to reduce reliance on tabbing into the quest book but that is an ongoing project."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cThis set of quests also breaks from the &nstory driven nature&r&c of the main line, including &n&l&ointentional misdirection&r&c. "
				""
				"&4If you wish to avoid these quests&c, &nonly the introductory quest for this one read-me will have a berry to claim&r&c. "
				""
				"&6You have been warned."
			]
