				"If you are looking to speedrun towards &d24 mechanical assemblers&r &e(being the bare minimum to manually use)&r, that will require &b14 etched living wood&r assuming &czero infrastructure or automation&r so it would be smart to aim for about a stack especially considering how useful &agearboxes&r are"
