		{
			dependencies: ["3E7BB1B6448D05B6"]
			description: [
				"The neat (mod by vazkii) thing about create machines is that how you input the rotation is visible on the machine itself."
				""
				"For the &bmechanical press&r you can see the sides resemble that of a &eshaft&r meaning connecting a shaft here will run the machine."
				""
				"The &bmechanical press&r itself once given rotation, will perform a craft by squashing whatever is below it given it's a valid item (if it exists as a recipe). Sometimes a &abasin&r is needed for the craft. For non basin crafts a &adepot&r can hold the items in place so you don't have to worry about them despawning if you forget"
				""
				"As a side note you may notice both sides of the shaft within the machine rotate, this is a key feature in compacting setups as &dmost machines can pass rotation through themselves in some way&r, just need to pay attention to how they look visually."
			]
			icon: "create:mechanical_press"
