			description: [
				"Dripstone? What for?"
				""
				"Well &cLava&r is needed for automatic production of &aAndesite&r and dripstone is able to get you a fairly free source of lava!"
				""
				"How? It's Simple!"
				""
				"Simply follow this design:"
				"&c[L]&r - Lava Source Block"
				"&6[D]&r - Dripstone Block"
				"&e[d]&r - Pointed Dripstone"
				"[a] - Air Gap"
				"&b[C] - Cauldron"
				""
				"From here you can use &dmechanical pipes&r from create to pull the lava into a tank."
				"A setup of about 20-40 cauldrons is sufficient to comfortably get through Tier 0 "
