			dependencies: ["05C0FBBDDC62201D"]
			description: ["Chutes are like hoppers, but way faster straight dowards. They cant output to the side unless you use &afunnels&r or &aa vanilla hopper&r but they do have the upside of being able to send items vertically with the use of an &bencased fan&r. Do Note: &dThe direction the fan spins matters so double check the fan is pushing instead of sucking&r"]
