				""
				"For anyone that hasn't been graced by the agony of accidentally making obsidian on a skyblock &ehere is a fairly simple setup for a &6cobblestone generator&r that will work:&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cDo Note:&r The setup written below is to be &bvisualized being vertical&r, 3 blocks tall, so the drill is up top and the hopper is below"
				""
				"&c[L] - Lava Source Block&r"
				"&7[C] - Where the cobblestone forms&r"
				"&3[W] - Water Source Block&r"
				"&b[w] - Flowing Water"
