		{
			dependencies: ["2E96FA6479D27C27"]
			description: [
				"So much cobble flowing in! These furnaces are so slow, and worse, they eat fuel!"
				""
				"Good news! This is a &dskill issue&r, and the solution is &bEncased Fans&r!"
				""
				"Encased fans can &eentirely replace&r the use of &efurnaces and smokers&r with additional functionality."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"By placing &bWater, &cLava,&r or &6Fire&r directly infront of an encased fan pushing air forward, that gust of wind can &bwash, &cblast,&r or &6smoke&r items dropped in front of it."
				""
				"The amount you drop at once does affect the processing times, but the effect is fairly small"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Much like mechanical presses &adepots&r work here too, but outside of manual use, the &breal automation solution&r is to have one blow over a long belt moving towards it &6slowly&r to ensure the items process"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/fan_example.png width:137 height:77 align:center}"
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
