		{
			dependencies: ["58FEDD50B927AA01"]
			description: [
				"Without access to &bDeployers&r at this stage you may be tempted to forgo an automated farm until you can make one."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This, however, is an &cunecessary burden&r upon yourself. "
				""
				"Setting up the farm &bdeployerless&r will still aid massively in reducing your &epersonal labor involvement&r with collecting a basic resource. "
				""
				"Running over to replant saplings is still &aless work&r than replanting and harvesting yourself."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Also, thanks to the mod &bQuark&r dispensers are able to place blocks and crops. "
				""
				"So if you are willing to make an &eunconventional farm&r and fiddle with redstone you can fully automate it at this stage."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&7There also may be a secret mechanic with dispensers to avoid deployers entirely..."
