		{
			dependencies: ["679AC30680D0664F"]
			description: [
				"Wait but the &bbelt sander&r is locked behind a &cbrass casing&r. Don't we need to automate things?"
				""
				"&6Good eye&r! But &enot sharp enough&r."
				""
				"This recipe specifically is an &oinvitation&r to look more closely at existing recipes. "
				""
				"&n&o&dLearn to dive through the recipe chains in REI&r. You may spot a work around.... &7Hint Hint&r."
			]
			icon: "botania:polished_livingrock"
			id: "1ECD32BB25F43FC0"
			subtitle: "Automatic Sanding?!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "73671101896D22B9"
