			title: "Let me get that for you"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4FDDF94EC02A0D02"]
			description: [
				"&6[W] To Ponder!&r"
				""
				"The &dInterceptor&r is useful for automation, but it doesn't handle fulfulling the original request once the item has been resupplied."
				""
				"That task goes to the Corporea Retainer."
				"Place it &nnext to&r a Corporea Interceptor. No need to place a spark on the retainer."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"When the interceptor activates, the retainer will &aremember&r what the original request was. Sending a &credstone pulse&r to it will &bre-trigger the original request&r, from wherever in the network it came from, be it a funnel, index or cube."
				""
				"In other words, its purpose is to signal to the network when an item has been resupplied and to try to fulfill the request again."
			]
			icon: "botania:corporea_retainer"
			id: "56BAD950091D55D1"
			subtitle: "I forgor"
